Package: joinme
Type: Package
Title: Joint Nested Mixed-effects (JoiNMe) Model for Multivariate Longitudinal and Survival Data
Version: 0.0.1.2608
Author: Trinh Dong <trinh.dong@ncl.ac.uk>
Maintainer: Trinh Dong <trinh.dong@ncl.ac.uk>
Description: Bayesian joint models linking multivariate longitudinal markers with
    time-to-event outcomes using Stan. Supports mixed families, association
    transforms, covariance regression, and dynamic prediction.
URL: https://trinhdhk.github.io/joinme, https://trinhdhk.github.io/joinme/
